  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "複雜參數式設計",
    "sub_ename": "ADVANCED PARAMETRIC DESIGN AND APPLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培育學員如何具備網格幾何、演算法、迴圈等。學生們必?從自然界中的任何事物，找出構成型態的基礎胚騰，再有效應用三維設計的專業技能整理這些構成變數並杜撰出構成型態的胚騰語法。成為未來在與產業接軌上的優勢。",
    "describe_eh": "In order to have more advantages and challenges to connect with the industries in the future, students will be able to apply grid gcometry, algorithm, and loop in the lecture. The lecture will require that students select an object in nature as a basic pattern of the structure, and then organize the structure variable with 3D design to fabricate a generative form of the structure.",
